      "writtenOn": "2023-10-04T09:26:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Does the STM32\u0027s option byte mean that it can lock the flash with byte granularity?  If it is, I don\u0027t think it can apply to the npcx\u0027s internal flash because it is the standard SPI nor flash.",
      "parentUuid": "c64c8a38_e9b12d4c",
      "revId": "661967462a946c1854cc29eeb90fd9ea81235231",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
